<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρῡμός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρύος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>icy cold, frost</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ κρυμόν</span> in
				<i>frost</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				681
			</span></i>: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τοὺς κρυμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					11.2.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				10.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				3.9.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>chill, cold fit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				507
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.</u>
				3.1.19
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυμός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.30.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. χολῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					682
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.53
			</span></i> (pl.). (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυμνὸς ἢ
			κρυμός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>)</div>
